---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ThemeToggle from '../../components/ThemeToggle.astro';
import FeatherIcon from '../../components/FeatherIcon.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Instant KW Privacy Policy | Lakhan Dewangan"
  description="Official Privacy Policy for Instant KW Google Autocomplete & Wildcard Harvester Chrome Extension."
>
  <!-- Header -->
  <header class="dark:bg-primary-dark bg-primary-light text-white p-6 rounded-b-xl shadow-lg">
    <div class="container mx-auto max-w-5xl flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <a href="/instant-kw" class="flex items-center gap-2 hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity text-sm font-medium bg-white/10 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg">
          <FeatherIcon name="arrow-left" class="w-4 h-4 text-white" />
          <span>Back to Instant KW</span>
        </a>
        <span class="text-white/40">|</span>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <img 
            src="/assets/instant-kw/icon128.png" 
            alt="Instant KW Icon" 
            class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg shadow object-contain bg-white/10 p-1" 
            width="40" 
            height="40" 
          />
          <div>
            <h1 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold leading-tight">Instant KW Privacy Policy</h1>
            <p class="text-xs md:text-sm text-indigo-200">Chrome Web Store Compliance & Data Protection Policy</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <a href="/instant-kw/support" class="bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white font-medium px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-sm transition-colors">
          Support Portal
        </a>
        <ThemeToggle />
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Main Content -->
  <section class="p-6 md:p-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <div class="dark:bg-surface-dark bg-surface-light border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 shadow-xl">
      <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mb-6">
        Last updated: August 27, 2026 · Developer: <strong>Lakhan Dewangan</strong> (<a href="https://lakhandewangan.com" class="text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 underline">lakhandewangan.com</a>)
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">1. Overview</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        <strong>Instant KW - Google Autocomplete & Wildcard Harvester</strong> ("Extension") is committed to protecting user privacy and ensuring full compliance with the Google Chrome Web Store Developer Program Policies.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">2. Information Collection and Usage</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-3 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        <li><strong>Zero Personal Data Collection:</strong> The Extension does NOT collect, transmit, track, store, or sell any personally identifiable information (PII), browsing history, IP addresses, financial details, health info, or user credentials.</li>
        <li><strong>Local Storage Processing:</strong> Any seed keywords entered by the user and the autocomplete suggestions returned by Google are processed and saved exclusively on your local device using the browser's <code class="bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 font-mono text-xs">chrome.storage.local</code> storage API.</li>
        <li><strong>No Third-Party Transmission:</strong> None of your stored keywords, project histories, or exported CSV files are ever transmitted to any external remote servers, third-party analytics platforms, tracking networks, or developers.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">3. Chrome Web Store Policy Certifications</h2>
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200 dark:border-emerald-800/60 bg-emerald-50/50 dark:bg-emerald-950/20 mb-6 space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
        <p class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-300">
          <FeatherIcon name="check-circle" class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500" />
          Official Certification Declarations:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 pl-2 text-xs md:text-sm">
          <li>The Extension does not sell user data to third parties.</li>
          <li>The Extension does not use or transfer user data for purposes unrelated to the item's core single purpose.</li>
          <li>The Extension does not use or transfer user data to determine creditworthiness or for lending purposes.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">4. Permissions Explanation</h2>
      <div class="space-y-3 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
        <div class="p-3.5 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800/40">
          <strong class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-mono">storage</strong>: Required to save harvested keyword suggestions and project history locally on the user's browser.
        </div>
        <div class="p-3.5 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800/40">
          <strong class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-mono">downloads</strong>: Required to allow users to export and download structured CSV keyword files directly to their local downloads folder.
        </div>
        <div class="p-3.5 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800/40">
          <strong class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-mono">tabs / activeTab / scripting</strong>: Required to open the Keyword Studio workspace dashboard tab in your browser and inspect DOM suggestion elements if visual search automation is enabled.
        </div>
        <div class="p-3.5 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800/40">
          <strong class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-mono">Host Permissions (*://suggestqueries.google.com/*, *://*.google.com/*)</strong>: Required to fetch search suggestion queries from Google's public autocomplete endpoint on your behalf.
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">5. Single Purpose Declaration</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        The sole single purpose of Instant KW is to assist users in keyword research by harvesting Google Autocomplete suggestions and wildcard variations and exporting them to CSV format.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">6. Contact Developer</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
        If you have questions regarding this Privacy Policy, please visit our <a href="/instant-kw/support" class="text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 underline font-semibold">Support Portal</a> or contact developer <strong>Lakhan Dewangan</strong> directly at <a href="mailto:dewanganlakhan@gmail.com" class="text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 underline font-semibold">dewanganlakhan@gmail.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <footer class="dark:bg-primary-dark bg-primary-light text-white p-6 text-center rounded-t-xl mt-8">
    <div class="container mx-auto max-w-5xl flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm">
      <div>
        &copy; 2026 Lakhan Dewangan · Instant KW Privacy Policy
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <a href="/instant-kw" class="hover:underline">Instant KW Landing Page</a>
        <span>·</span>
        <a href="/instant-kw/support" class="hover:underline">Support Portal</a>
        <span>·</span>
        <a href="/" class="hover:underline">Portfolio Home</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>
</Layout>
